            {"speaker": "Alex", "voice": "Puck", "text": f"[warmly] I am your host Alex Mercer with Dr. Elena Vance, and today is {date_str}, and you're listening to Future Human Daily. Today we are diving into a liberating technological breakthrough: Biomimetic Energy and Wireless Resonant Power—the end of tangled charging cords, clunky charging bricks, and dead batteries forever!"},
            {"speaker": "Elena", "voice": "Kore", "text": "[cheerful] Happy Tuesday, Alex! And oh man, how much mental bandwidth and frustration do we all spend hunting around for charging cables, crawling behind hotel nightstands to find an open outlet, and stressing out when our phone's battery indicator flashes red at four percent on a busy workday?"},
